1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:03,618
What if the Moon suddenly
started falling toward Earth?

2
00:00:03,638 --> 00:00:06,298
At first, it would look breathtaking.

3
00:00:06,318 --> 00:00:09,698
A gigantic Moon dominating the night sky.

4
00:00:09,718 --> 00:00:14,448
But the closer it came, the more dangerous
its gravitational pull would become.

5
00:00:14,468 --> 00:00:17,583
Extreme tides could flood coastal cities.

6
00:00:17,603 --> 00:00:20,624
Powerful tidal forces
could tear the Moon apart,

7
00:00:20,644 --> 00:00:23,894
creating an enormous ring
of debris around Earth.

8
00:00:23,914 --> 00:00:27,008
Some of that debris could
rain down on our planet.

9
00:00:27,028 --> 00:00:31,488
And if a collision occurred, the energy
released could devastate Earth's surface.

10
00:00:31,508 --> 00:00:35,770
Our familiar blue planet might
become an unrecognizable world.

11
00:00:35,790 --> 00:00:37,858
The Moon looks peaceful tonight.

12
00:00:37,858 --> 00:00:40,679
But imagine if it started getting closer.
